WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.068
- There's one nurse
that I work with

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.236
who is seven months pregnant,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.971 align:start size:88% position:13%
and this nurse actually
wants the vaccine.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.206
She said, "I want the vaccine.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.140
I'll get the vaccine.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.075
Just wait until I have my baby

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.111
and I will come
back vaccinated."

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.847 align:start size:97% position:3%
And she was forced to
resign because they said no.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.115
At seven months pregnant,

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.217
this is someone who
actually wanted it,

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.752
and they're holding
the line and said,

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.721
"No, you're not gonna be
here come September 27th."

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.390
And she resigned in
lieu of being fired

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.426
so she can keep some benefits
there, but she was forced out.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.995
(gentle music)

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.901 line:0%
- I'm Dave Rubin,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.136 line:0%
and we're doing something
a little different today.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.337 line:0%
You know, I've been
telling you guys

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.006 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
that my inbox is
absolutely blowing up

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:43.443
from people reaching out to
me about losing their jobs

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.178
or potentially losing their jobs

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.579
because of these
vaccine mandates.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.481
I'm hearing from people
in the healthcare field,

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.650
I'm hearing from
airline workers,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.753 align:start size:97% position:3%
people just across the
economy, across the country.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I wanted to
start interviewing a
couple of the people

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.591
that are speaking
out against this.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.794
And I saw a tweet from this guy

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.595
that I'm about to
introduce to you.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.299
He is a frontline ER
nurse, former EMT,

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.301 align:start size:88% position:13%
and current
congressional candidate

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.271 align:start size:84% position:16%
in New York's 3rd
District, Kevin Surdi.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.173
Welcome to "The Rubin Report."

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.307 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Thank you so
much for having me.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.775
It's an honor to be here.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.411
- Kevin, I mentioned to you
right before we started,

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.313
New York's 3rd district,

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.148
I'm homegrown Syosset, man.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.217
That means my parents are in

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.519 align:start size:84% position:16%
what could potentially
be your district.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:28.688 align:start size:88% position:13%
What do you want people
to know about you

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.156
and why you're running,

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.059 align:start size:97% position:3%
before we get to the specifics
on vaccines and all that?

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start position:0% line:0%
- Yeah, so I'm running to
really bring back representation

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.530 line:0%
to the district.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.466 line:0%
And as a congressman, your
title is representative,

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:42.535 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I feel they have
completely lost sight of that.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.537
And a lot of them
are running for

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.106
to keep themselves in office

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:49.676
and they run for the title and
the position of congressman.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.377 align:start size:84% position:16%
And they've
completely lost sight

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.079
of what their job really is,

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:56.249
and that's to represent the
people that voted them in.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.618 align:start size:88% position:13%
I'm running on a term
limits platform as well,

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:84% position:16%
which will limit that
availability to turn
it into a career,

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.991
'cause I see Congress as
a service to your country.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.427
It's not a career to
get yourself rich.

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:10.830 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Okay, so I just mentioned
my inbox is just crazy

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.031
with people reaching out to me,

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.666 align:start size:84% position:16%
wanting their
stories to be heard,

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.969
just telling me about all
sorts of awful things,

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:19.372 align:start size:97% position:3%
having to make the choice
between basically being fired

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.542 align:start size:84% position:16%
or going against their
conscience related
to the vaccines.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:23.810
But I saw a tweet from you.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.446 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is why I reached
out to you specifically.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:28.348
You sent this just a
couple of days ago.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:30.483
"I'm an ER nurse on Long Island.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:34.020
I'm pro-vaccine
and anti-mandate.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.257 align:start size:84% position:16%
In my department, 4
nurses either resigned

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.726 align:start size:84% position:16%
or will be fired
due to the mandates.

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.595
24 administrators
have been fired.

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:46.666
Another 5 were forced against
their will to get the shot.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:49.602
This mandate will
destroy hospitals."

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.771 align:start position:0%
Okay, so that's what's
happening to you in Long Island.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:54.407
Obviously, this is
close to my heart.

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:57.410
Well, first, do you mind
if I ask what hospital?

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.145
- I work for Northwell,

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:01.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
one of the larger hospital
systems on Long Island.

00:03:01.781 --> 00:03:02.615
- Gotcha.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:07.554 align:start size:97% position:3%
Now that in mind, we also
have the governor of New York,

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.522
who nobody voted for,

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:13.126
who in essence is firing
83,000 healthcare workers.

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:15.295
The people we were
told are the heroes,

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:17.697 align:start size:97% position:3%
they are going to be replaced
by the National Guard

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:20.600
if they so choose not
to get the vaccine.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.101
So, I'll let you
unpack that tweet.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:25.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
But to start, you're
saying you're pro-vaccine,

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.040
you're anti-mandate.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.775
So, do you wanna clean
that up a little bit?

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:31.277
- Absolutely, and I,
myself, I'm vaccinated.

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:33.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got both my shots and
my family got their shots.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:34.914
All my friends got it.

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:37.217
I think the vaccine does help

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.485
limit the symptoms of
COVID if you get it.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:41.688
So, it does prevent ICU stays.

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:42.922
It does work.

00:03:42.922 --> 00:03:44.657
The problem is it
doesn't prevent you

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.392
from spreading the virus.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.895
So the vaccine that
I got, it is a risk,

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:52.031 align:start position:0%
or any vaccine we take, any
medicine, any medical procedure,

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.633
there's always risks to it,

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:57.170
and understanding those
risks, I got the vaccine.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.405
And I would encourage you
people to get the vaccine.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:02.675
However, it's not a
perfect vaccine yet.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.478
This thing cannot
stop transmission.

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:07.347
It can't stop you
from getting COVID,

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:10.483 align:start size:88% position:13%
which the CDC also just
said the other day.

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:12.685
We can't be firing people

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:14.687
that choose not to
get the vaccine.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:17.323
Thankfully, my wife was
pregnant during this

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.092 line:0%
and we chose not to
get her the vaccine

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:20.393 line:0%
while she was pregnant.

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:23.596 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
After she gave birth,
we gave her the vaccine.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.732 line:0%
But what if my wife was a nurse?

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:28.101
My wife would be forced to
be either get the vaccine

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.569
while you're pregnant or fired.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:30.737
And thankfully at the time,

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:32.372 align:start size:84% position:16%
we had the opportunity
of that choice.

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:34.374
And that choice is not
being offered today.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:35.775
So I'm pro-vaccine,

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:37.610 align:start size:88% position:13%
I just don't think
anybody should be fired

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.779 align:start size:97% position:3%
if they think they don't want
the vaccine at this time.

00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:41.714
- You know, bizarrely
on the pregnancy front,

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
you may have seen the
head of the CDC, Walensky,

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.118
just a couple of
days ago saying,

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:47.720
"Oh, it's completely
fine for pregnant women

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.489 align:start size:97% position:3%
and for breastfeeding
women," et cetera, et cetera,

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:52.892
except there's simply no way
they could have that data yet.

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.394
- It's too soon.

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:55.962 align:start size:97% position:3%
If we look at following the
science, we're all scientists.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.163
We have degrees.

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:58.798
We've been doing this
for over 20 years.

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.266
Data takes time.

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:02.302
This has only been
six, eight months.

00:05:02.302 --> 00:05:04.737 align:start size:88% position:13%
Some of these women that
have had the vaccine

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.773 align:start size:84% position:16%
and given birth,
it's not long enough

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:08.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
for us to see the effects
of what's happening.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.110
And there have been so
many FDA approved drugs

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.012
and treatments in the past

00:05:13.012 --> 00:05:15.315 align:start size:84% position:16%
that we're realizing
now are not safe

00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:16.549
and they have recalls.

00:05:16.549 --> 00:05:19.085 align:start size:84% position:16%
And it's just too
soon to be mandated.

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.586 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's gotta be a
choice at this point.

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:23.089
- When you mentioned some of
the nurses and administrators

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.625 align:start position:0%
that you know that now are
either being forced to step down

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:26.793
or ultimately will be fired,

00:05:26.793 --> 00:05:28.328 align:start size:84% position:16%
or in essence,
they're furloughed.

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:30.530 align:start size:97% position:3%
You don't have to go to
work, but you don't get paid,

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.700
so you're fired by any
reasonable estimation.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:37.170 align:start size:81% position:19%
What have their
rationalities been

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.238
as to why they're not
getting vaccinated?

00:05:40.273 --> 00:05:41.507
- It ranges.

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:42.709
There's one nurse
that I work with

00:05:42.709 --> 00:05:44.377
who is seven months pregnant,

00:05:44.377 --> 00:05:46.245 align:start size:88% position:13%
and this nurse actually
wants the vaccine.

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:47.480
She said, "I want the vaccine.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.414
I'll get the vaccine.

00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:50.350
Just wait until I have my baby

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.385
and I will come
back vaccinated."

00:05:52.385 --> 00:05:55.121 align:start size:97% position:3%
And she was forced to
resign because they said no.

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:56.356
At seven months pregnant,

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:58.491
this is someone who
actually wanted it

00:05:58.491 --> 00:06:00.026
and they're holding
the line and said,

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:02.929
"No, you're not gonna be
here come September 27th."

00:06:02.929 --> 00:06:04.597
And she resigned in
lieu of being fired

00:06:04.597 --> 00:06:07.867
so she can keep some benefits
there, but she was forced out.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.570 align:start size:97% position:3%
I have another great colleague
of mine who's in her 30s.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.271
She's had a stroke already.

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.707
She's blind in one eye,
had open heart surgery,

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:16.776
and we know that there
is a very small risk,

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:19.812 align:start size:97% position:3%
but the risk is there, of
blood clots with the vaccine.

00:06:19.812 --> 00:06:21.347
And she said, "I'm
not taking that risk.

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:23.282
I'm already blind in one eye.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:26.953 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't wanna be blind in
another eye if I get this clot

00:06:26.953 --> 00:06:28.788 align:start size:88% position:13%
and I'm predispositioned
to have a stroke."

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:30.289
This is somebody who is a nurse.

00:06:30.289 --> 00:06:33.459 align:start size:97% position:3%
She knows what she's talking
about, and she was fired.

00:06:33.459 --> 00:06:35.328
We have others on
religious beliefs

00:06:35.328 --> 00:06:37.196
and others who just don't know.

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:39.599
They've had COVID, they
have the antibodies,

00:06:39.599 --> 00:06:41.200
and the whole purpose
to get the vaccine

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.535
is to give you antibodies.

00:06:42.535 --> 00:06:43.803
So we're a little confused.

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:45.538
If you already have
natural antibodies,

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:48.808 align:start size:97% position:3%
why are you giving me another
shot to have antibodies

00:06:48.808 --> 00:06:51.177
and then requiring me to
get multiple boosters?

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:54.414 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Have you brought that,
sorry to interrupt,

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
have you guys brought that
up with administrators?

00:06:56.349 --> 00:06:58.885
I mean, I get that it's
just going down the chain

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:00.153 align:start size:97% position:3%
and everyone's just like,
"Well, they told me to do it

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:02.054
and you told me to do it
and we're gonna do it."

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:04.657 align:start position:0%
But when you bring that up about
the natural antibody thing,

00:07:04.657 --> 00:07:07.560
which nobody seems
to wanna discuss,

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.328
Fauci and the head of the
CDC and everything else,

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:12.231 align:start size:97% position:3%
what are the administrators
saying to you guys?

00:07:12.231 --> 00:07:13.499
- The administrators are saying

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:15.034
they're following
the CDC protocol,

00:07:15.034 --> 00:07:17.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they're not going back
to us with the science

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:18.538
that we know that they have.

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:20.306 align:start size:97% position:3%
A lot of these administrators
are doctors and nurses,

00:07:20.306 --> 00:07:22.008
and this isn't a nursing thing.

00:07:22.008 --> 00:07:23.943
This has spread out
to pharmacists and
doctors and nurses.

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.411
It's all throughout healthcare

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:28.214 align:start size:97% position:3%
of multiple people wanting
the vaccine or not wanting it.

00:07:28.214 --> 00:07:30.950
And the majority of them
have already had COVID.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.685 align:start size:88% position:13%
They've tested positive
through blood work

00:07:32.685 --> 00:07:35.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they have antibodies,
and they're being told,

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.856
"No, you still have
to get the shot."

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:38.357 align:start size:84% position:16%
And that's what
we're really fighting

00:07:38.357 --> 00:07:40.259 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I'm trying to represent
a whole group here,

00:07:40.259 --> 00:07:42.929
because it doesn't make sense.

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:45.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
If we're giving you a shot
to give you antibodies,

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:46.299
but you already have antibodies,

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:48.568 align:start size:88% position:13%
which has also been
proven to be more likely

00:07:48.568 --> 00:07:50.870 align:start size:84% position:16%
at stopping you from
getting the virus

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.305
if you have natural antibodies

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:54.607 align:start size:84% position:16%
than the synthetic
ones from the vaccine.

00:07:54.607 --> 00:07:59.612 align:start size:97% position:3%
- When you hear the,
quote-unquote, "trusted class"

00:08:00.746 --> 00:08:01.948 align:start size:84% position:16%
and the media people
talk about COVID

00:08:01.948 --> 00:08:04.750
yet not bring up
natural antibodies,

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:09.021
not bring up some of the
other remedies for COVID,

00:08:09.021 --> 00:08:11.390
we're not allowed to talk
about some of this stuff,

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.360
it's like, what are
you guys thinking?

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.530 align:start size:84% position:16%
Are you shocked that
suddenly medicine

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.031
is not allowed to
be talked about,

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:21.667
that certain remedies are not
allowed to be talked about?

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:23.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Well, I think
governance should employ.

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:26.105 align:start size:97% position:3%
They should not be dictating
how medicine should work.

00:08:26.105 --> 00:08:27.840
We are the people, we've
gone to medical school,

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.842
we've gone to nursing school,
we've gone to pharmacy school.

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:30.877 align:start size:81% position:19%
We know what we're
talking about.

00:08:30.877 --> 00:08:32.812
We know how to treat this.

00:08:32.812 --> 00:08:34.981
They should not be telling
us what we should be doing,

00:08:34.981 --> 00:08:36.415
what we can't be doing.

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:38.651
And it's not based on science.

00:08:38.651 --> 00:08:40.686 align:start size:97% position:3%
We're not seeing that
there's any data behind this,

00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:42.188
so we can only allude

00:08:42.188 --> 00:08:44.156 align:start size:84% position:16%
that this is some
kind of a power grab

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:45.625
or there's money behind it.

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:47.693 align:start size:97% position:3%
There's some other reason
because it's not the science.

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.061 align:start size:84% position:16%
We're trying to follow
the science of it

00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:50.263
and they're telling us not to.

00:08:50.263 --> 00:08:52.265 align:start size:84% position:16%
- If I would have
said to you a year ago

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:54.200
at the height of
COVID, let's say,

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.536
or even a little more than a
year ago, year and a half ago,

00:08:56.536 --> 00:08:58.938
it's now May of 2020,
something like that,

00:08:58.938 --> 00:09:00.506
if I would have said to you,

00:09:00.506 --> 00:09:02.642
"In a year and a half from now,

00:09:02.642 --> 00:09:04.410 align:start size:84% position:16%
half of your friends
and colleagues

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
are gonna be stepping down
or forced out or fired

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.848
because they didn't
take a vaccine,"

00:09:08.848 --> 00:09:10.049 align:start size:84% position:16%
what do you think
you would have said,

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:11.317
when at that time you guys

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:13.553
were the greatest
heroes of all time?

00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:15.354
- I probably would have laughed

00:09:15.354 --> 00:09:17.757
and I'd say, "There's no way
that's possible to happen."

00:09:17.757 --> 00:09:19.492 align:start size:84% position:16%
When we were in this,
the thick of it,

00:09:19.492 --> 00:09:21.594 align:start size:84% position:16%
we didn't have
enough PPE to wear.

00:09:21.594 --> 00:09:24.530 align:start size:97% position:3%
I myself was wearing the
same mask for weeks on ends.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:28.034 align:start size:97% position:3%
And before COVID, that mask
was supposed to be worn

00:09:28.034 --> 00:09:29.502
one patient at a time.

00:09:29.502 --> 00:09:31.003 align:start size:97% position:3%
You wear it, you take it off,
you throw in the garbage,

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:32.471 line:0%
you get a new one.

00:09:32.471 --> 00:09:34.707 line:0%
And we were wearing this
for weeks at the same time.

00:09:34.707 --> 00:09:36.108 line:0%
I even had one of those
straps break on a mask

00:09:36.108 --> 00:09:38.277 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
and I was told, "Just
tie it together."

00:09:38.277 --> 00:09:40.680
So we went through
a lot, sacrifice,

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.815
and it's a risk that we
all knew we were taking.

00:09:42.815 --> 00:09:44.283 align:start size:84% position:16%
We were in healthcare,
that's what we do.

00:09:44.283 --> 00:09:45.518
We're first responders,

00:09:45.518 --> 00:09:47.486
and any of us would do
it again immediately

00:09:47.486 --> 00:09:48.955
without any hesitation.

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:50.156
And we're still doing it.

00:09:50.156 --> 00:09:51.357 align:start size:84% position:16%
We're still treating
COVID patients,

00:09:51.357 --> 00:09:53.960 align:start size:84% position:16%
many vaccinated COVID
patients as well.

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:56.862
And for them to say,
"You're gonna be fired

00:09:56.862 --> 00:09:58.364
for not getting a vaccine,"

00:09:58.364 --> 00:10:01.500
after everything we just went
through, it's mind boggling.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.436
And where I'm really sticking

00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:05.338
on why this doesn't make sense,

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:07.607
because we are in a
healthcare pandemic,

00:10:07.607 --> 00:10:10.743 align:start size:84% position:16%
we are in a national
nursing shortage

00:10:10.743 --> 00:10:12.178
right now, currently today,

00:10:12.178 --> 00:10:14.647 align:start position:0%
before a lot of people are
even being fired or terminated.

00:10:14.647 --> 00:10:16.649
I get text messages
every single day,

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:19.485
all across Long Island,
begging for overtime,

00:10:19.485 --> 00:10:20.920
"Come in, we need help.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.456
$250 extra to come in."

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:26.592 align:start size:84% position:16%
If you lose just one
or two providers,

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:28.494 align:start size:88% position:13%
you are gonna devastate
that department.

00:10:28.494 --> 00:10:29.862
We're already short-staffed.

00:10:29.862 --> 00:10:31.697
So if you're gonna
fire more people,

00:10:31.697 --> 00:10:34.400
I don't understand
how that's better,

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
because me personally, I'd
much rather get treated

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:38.571 align:start size:84% position:16%
by an unvaccinated
person with antibodies

00:10:38.571 --> 00:10:40.539
than being treated
by nobody at all.

00:10:40.539 --> 00:10:41.774
And there's gonna be a time

00:10:41.774 --> 00:10:42.808
where you're gonna
come to that hospital

00:10:42.808 --> 00:10:44.110
and your care is
gonna be delayed

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:44.810
because there are not
gonna be enough people

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.312
to care for you.

00:10:46.312 --> 00:10:47.613
- Right, and by the way,
do we even have any numbers

00:10:47.613 --> 00:10:50.282
or do you know of
any numbers of,

00:10:50.282 --> 00:10:53.919 align:start position:0%
at the peak of this thing,
unvaccinated healthcare workers

00:10:53.919 --> 00:10:56.422 align:start size:97% position:3%
that were somehow infecting
people at hospitals?

00:10:56.422 --> 00:10:59.291
Have they done any studies
on that that you know of?

00:10:59.291 --> 00:11:00.860
- Not to my knowledge
and I highly doubt it.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.964
And a lot of us got COVID
during the peak of it.

00:11:04.964 --> 00:11:06.298 align:start size:97% position:3%
You're out for two or three
weeks and you're fine.

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:07.133
You're right back.

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:07.967
Yes, it was devastating.

00:11:07.967 --> 00:11:09.201
A lot of people did die.

00:11:09.201 --> 00:11:11.070
I held the hands
of dying patients.

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.906
It was a lot to deal
with in the hospitals.

00:11:13.906 --> 00:11:16.409
But there's a high
survivability rate.

00:11:16.409 --> 00:11:18.744
Personally, in one of
the hospital systems,

00:11:18.744 --> 00:11:21.047
we did lose a few
healthcare workers,

00:11:21.047 --> 00:11:23.649
but the majority
of them were fine.

00:11:23.649 --> 00:11:26.585
And if they got COVID,
they got the antibodies

00:11:26.585 --> 00:11:29.188 align:start size:88% position:13%
and they're still
working currently today.

00:11:29.188 --> 00:11:30.923
Why are we forcing
this vaccine on them?

00:11:30.923 --> 00:11:32.491
Even though we think
the vaccine does work

00:11:32.491 --> 00:11:34.060
and it limits your symptoms,

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.095
but a lot of people have
very legitimate reasons

00:11:36.095 --> 00:11:38.597
like I spoke about to
not get the vaccine.

00:11:38.597 --> 00:11:40.800
Why are we firing these people?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.268
It just doesn't make sense.

00:11:42.268 --> 00:11:45.771 align:start position:0%
We need healthcare professionals
right now more than ever,

00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:47.506 align:start size:97% position:3%
and if we're short-staffed,
it doesn't make sense.

00:11:47.506 --> 00:11:49.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
- For some of my audience
that may be hesitant,

00:11:49.642 --> 00:11:51.343
and as I have said completely

00:11:51.343 --> 00:11:52.845
from the beginning
the entire time,

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:54.547 align:start size:97% position:3%
it's that I believe the
same position you're taking,

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:56.148
which is that you have
to make the right choice

00:11:56.148 --> 00:11:57.950
for yourself and you should
consult with your doctor

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.119
and your age and your
health and your diet

00:12:00.119 --> 00:12:01.721 align:start size:84% position:16%
and all of those
things should matter.

00:12:01.721 --> 00:12:03.222
If someone's hesitant,

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:06.492
do you have a recommendation
on which one they should take?

00:12:06.492 --> 00:12:09.161
Or just anything on
that side of things?

00:12:09.161 --> 00:12:10.129
- It'd be more of a conversation

00:12:10.129 --> 00:12:11.497
between them and their doctor.

00:12:11.497 --> 00:12:12.698 align:start size:84% position:16%
There hasn't really
been too much

00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:14.333 align:start size:84% position:16%
to prove one's better
than the other.

00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:17.937
Personally, I had Moderna,
the two shots that I got,

00:12:17.937 --> 00:12:19.772 align:start size:88% position:13%
my family got that one,
and we got that one

00:12:19.772 --> 00:12:22.308 align:start size:84% position:16%
because that's what
they offered that day.

00:12:22.308 --> 00:12:23.509
If they were offering Pfizer,

00:12:23.509 --> 00:12:24.744 align:start size:84% position:16%
I would have gotten
the Pfizer one.

00:12:24.744 --> 00:12:27.012
So, that's all up to
interpersonal choice.

00:12:27.012 --> 00:12:29.381
- What of your colleagues
that are now stepping down

00:12:29.381 --> 00:12:31.517
or being furloughed, et cetera,

00:12:31.517 --> 00:12:33.319
do they know what they're
gonna do with their lives?

00:12:33.319 --> 00:12:37.890 align:start size:84% position:16%
Most people don't
have months in salary

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.425
just waiting in the bank,

00:12:39.425 --> 00:12:42.061
and you didn't think you were
gonna step away from a career,

00:12:42.061 --> 00:12:42.928
and here we are.

00:12:43.863 --> 00:12:44.797
- It's very stressful.

00:12:44.797 --> 00:12:46.732
A lot of them have kids, too.

00:12:46.732 --> 00:12:48.100
There's one nurse,
she's a single mom,

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.069
been a nurse for quite
a few years in the ER,

00:12:50.069 --> 00:12:54.340
and she very reluctantly got
the vaccine against her will.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.075
She did not want this at all.

00:12:56.075 --> 00:12:57.376
She's very distressed

00:12:57.376 --> 00:12:58.844
because she's already
gotten the first shot.

00:12:58.844 --> 00:13:00.212
She goes, "I can't lose my job.

00:13:00.212 --> 00:13:01.680
I'm a single mom.

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:04.016 align:start position:0%
If I lose my job, I can't afford
my house or to feed my kid.

00:13:04.016 --> 00:13:05.317
I don't have a choice here."

00:13:05.317 --> 00:13:06.685
And that's just horrible to do

00:13:06.685 --> 00:13:08.921 align:start position:0%
to someone who's just sacrificed
their whole last year,

00:13:08.921 --> 00:13:11.190
working overtime,
coming in extra.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:13.659 align:start size:88% position:13%
We used to get undressed
outside of our house.

00:13:13.659 --> 00:13:15.094 align:start size:84% position:16%
I personally
quarantined two weeks

00:13:15.094 --> 00:13:16.395
away from my family
in the beginning,

00:13:16.395 --> 00:13:18.297
'cause I didn't know if
I would bring this home.

00:13:18.297 --> 00:13:20.699
And now this is someone that
wants to care for her child

00:13:20.699 --> 00:13:22.234 align:start size:84% position:16%
and she doesn't
have another option.

00:13:22.234 --> 00:13:24.737
So, she was forced
to get that vaccine.

00:13:24.737 --> 00:13:26.305
- Is there anything else
you want people to know?

00:13:26.305 --> 00:13:28.274
We're gonna do a whole
series of these shows.

00:13:28.274 --> 00:13:29.441
I'm gonna try to talk to people

00:13:29.441 --> 00:13:30.576 align:start size:84% position:16%
in all sorts of
different industries.

00:13:30.576 --> 00:13:32.111
And I just think it's important

00:13:32.111 --> 00:13:34.580 align:start size:88% position:13%
that people realize
what's actually
happening on the ground.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.614
Is there anything
that we missed here

00:13:35.614 --> 00:13:36.882
that you wanna get out?

00:13:36.882 --> 00:13:38.083
- Yeah, just two.

00:13:38.083 --> 00:13:39.919 align:start size:84% position:16%
If you do want to
find more information,

00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:44.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
my website,
SurdiForCongress.com,
S-U-R-D-I forCongress.com,

00:13:45.891 --> 00:13:47.326
a ton of information on
there you can follow.

00:13:47.326 --> 00:13:50.696 align:start position:0%
And one note about the governors
using the National Guard,

00:13:50.696 --> 00:13:53.432
this is a horrible
policy decision.

00:13:53.432 --> 00:13:55.601
God bless the people that
are in the National Guard.

00:13:55.601 --> 00:13:56.869
They're absolutely heroes.

00:13:56.869 --> 00:13:58.337
They do a ton of
great work for us.

00:13:58.337 --> 00:14:00.739 align:start size:97% position:3%
But if we're gonna
activate the medical people

00:14:00.739 --> 00:14:01.974
from the National Guard,

00:14:01.974 --> 00:14:03.742
these are doctors,
nurses, pharmacists,

00:14:03.742 --> 00:14:07.012 align:start size:88% position:13%
and they're working
right now in hospitals.

00:14:07.012 --> 00:14:09.982 align:start size:97% position:3%
The National Guard is a
part-time military position.

00:14:09.982 --> 00:14:12.685 align:start size:97% position:3%
What's gonna happen is when
the Guard is activated,

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:15.087 align:start size:97% position:3%
you're gonna pull these
full-time doctors and nurses

00:14:15.087 --> 00:14:17.489
that are working at
other hospitals today

00:14:17.489 --> 00:14:19.391
away from their home hospital

00:14:19.391 --> 00:14:20.993
and put them in other hospitals.

00:14:20.993 --> 00:14:23.829
So we're just gonna make
staffing shorter all around

00:14:23.829 --> 00:14:25.231
by deploying the National Guard.

00:14:25.231 --> 00:14:27.399 align:start size:88% position:13%
And I don't know if a
lot of people know that.

00:14:27.399 --> 00:14:29.869
The National Guard is a
horrible policy decision,

00:14:31.036 --> 00:14:32.872
amongst from a lot of
other horrible ones.

00:14:32.872 --> 00:14:34.139 align:start size:81% position:19%
It's not gonna
solve the problem.

00:14:34.139 --> 00:14:35.708
It's actually gonna
make it a lot worse.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:38.577
- Are you hopeful that enough
people will hear the message

00:14:38.577 --> 00:14:39.879
that you're trying
to get out there,

00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:41.747
that enough people will
come around and be like,

00:14:41.747 --> 00:14:45.451 align:start position:0%
"Oh yeah, maybe my own personal
choice is more important

00:14:45.451 --> 00:14:47.419 align:start size:88% position:13%
than what the government
demands that I do."

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:49.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you sense that
something's moving there,

00:14:49.955 --> 00:14:51.490
that there's momentum there?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.058
- There are a lot of people.

00:14:53.058 --> 00:14:55.127 align:start size:97% position:3%
My big hope is the governor
comes to her senses

00:14:55.127 --> 00:14:56.362
and rescinds the order.

00:14:56.362 --> 00:14:58.097
- Yeah, I don't think so.

00:14:58.097 --> 00:14:59.732
- I don't think
so, it's my hope.

00:14:59.732 --> 00:15:01.634
Alabama, they rescinded it.

00:15:01.634 --> 00:15:05.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
There are some places
that they're not doing it.

00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:08.841
They kinda told the state,
"We're not gonna do this."

00:15:08.841 --> 00:15:10.309
And we're hoping they
stand their ground

00:15:10.309 --> 00:15:12.544 align:start size:88% position:13%
and they continue to
say, "This is my choice.

00:15:12.544 --> 00:15:15.080
Either I have antibodies
or I don't have antibodies,

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.350 align:start size:97% position:3%
but you can't force
something that is this new."

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people argue that
the vaccine is not new.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.254
The research has been there.

00:15:22.254 --> 00:15:24.657 line:0%
And I fully agree, the
research has been there.

00:15:24.657 --> 00:15:26.425 line:0%
But they haven't
used it on humans.

00:15:26.425 --> 00:15:28.727 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
This is a new thing that's
being actually used.

00:15:28.727 --> 00:15:30.729
We're still in a trial phase.

00:15:31.864 --> 00:15:33.032
I was fine getting the shot.

00:15:33.032 --> 00:15:34.767 align:start size:84% position:16%
I looked at the
research and the data

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:37.202 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I took the acknowledged
risk to get it.

00:15:37.202 --> 00:15:38.704
That was my choice.

00:15:38.704 --> 00:15:40.205
It was our choice that my
wife didn't get the vaccine

00:15:40.205 --> 00:15:41.340
while she was pregnant.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.042 align:start size:84% position:16%
Don't take the
choice out of people,

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:45.411 align:start size:97% position:3%
especially the people that are
fighting on the front lines

00:15:45.411 --> 00:15:46.912
to protect their community.

00:15:46.912 --> 00:15:49.048
They're putting themselves
and their families at risk.

00:15:49.048 --> 00:15:50.149
They still want to work.

00:15:50.149 --> 00:15:52.017
They still wanna care for you.

00:15:52.017 --> 00:15:53.519
And if you've got the vaccine,

00:15:53.519 --> 00:15:55.688
you can still spread the virus.

00:15:55.688 --> 00:15:59.191 align:start size:84% position:16%
So why is it that
we're firing people?

00:15:59.191 --> 00:16:00.626
Just give them a test.

00:16:00.626 --> 00:16:02.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd much rather test
every healthcare employee.

00:16:02.861 --> 00:16:04.964 align:start size:88% position:13%
When we come into work,
give us all a test.

00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:07.566
And that way we know for sure,
we don't have COVID that day

00:16:07.566 --> 00:16:09.034
and we won't spread
it to the patient.

00:16:09.034 --> 00:16:12.104
I think every healthcare
worker can get behind that.

00:16:12.104 --> 00:16:14.606 align:start size:88% position:13%
The flu vaccine was
mandated and they said,

00:16:14.606 --> 00:16:16.675
"Well, if you don't want the
flu vaccine, wear a mask."

00:16:16.675 --> 00:16:18.344 align:start size:84% position:16%
There's always been
another option.

00:16:18.344 --> 00:16:19.878
That's all we're asking for.

00:16:19.878 --> 00:16:21.613
Give us a test, let us know,
we absolutely don't have it,

00:16:21.613 --> 00:16:24.249
and that's actually the
safest thing you can do.

00:16:24.249 --> 00:16:25.084
But that's not even happening.

00:16:25.084 --> 00:16:26.218
This is a power grab.

00:16:26.218 --> 00:16:28.320 align:start size:88% position:13%
It feels like a
punishment of some sort,

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:29.822
and it's just not the
right thing to do.

00:16:29.822 --> 00:16:31.824
And patients are
going to suffer,

00:16:31.824 --> 00:16:33.058 align:start size:84% position:16%
which is why I'm
standing in this line.

00:16:33.058 --> 00:16:35.661 align:start size:84% position:16%
I can't have this
affect patient care.

00:16:35.661 --> 00:16:37.696 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Kevin, we, the people,
stand with you guys.

00:16:37.696 --> 00:16:39.198
It's SurdiForCongress.com.

00:16:39.198 --> 00:16:40.866
We're gonna link to
it right down below.

00:16:40.866 --> 00:16:44.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
And keep New York 3,
especially Syosset, safe.

00:16:44.036 --> 00:16:46.905
That's Billy Joel
country over there.

00:16:46.905 --> 00:16:47.840
- Will do.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.608
Please give us your support.

00:16:49.608 --> 00:16:51.377 align:start size:84% position:16%
There's a place to
donate on the website.

00:16:51.377 --> 00:16:54.179 align:start size:88% position:13%
Unfortunately, politics
does require money

00:16:54.179 --> 00:16:55.014
to get the message out.

00:16:55.014 --> 00:16:56.382
It's a sad part.

00:16:56.382 --> 00:16:58.450 align:start position:0%
Hopefully when I'm in Congress,
I can try to fix that.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.586
Send a donation, help us
get that message out there.

